OL,3,GNEWSATeenage boy badly hurt in unknown
OL,4,Asubstance attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy has been left with
OL,7,F"potentially life-changing" injuries
OL,8,Fafter an unknown substance was thrown
OL,9,Fat him in a city centre.
OL,11,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,12,Fthe substance was thrown in Exchange
OL,13,FSquare in Manchester at 18:00 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday after a row.
OL,16,FA 19-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of assault.
OL,19,FGMP said the victim was in his
OL,20,Fmid-teens and has appealed for any
OL,21,FCCTV, mobile or dashcam footage.
